  "fullDescription": "Transport your designs into the cyber aesthetic of the turn of the millennium with Toraku! Designed as a futuristic Y2K display font, it features extended blocky proportions, sharp forward-slanted stems, techno cutouts, and retro-futuristic geometric character silhouettes.\n\nIdeal for Y2K branding, sci-fi poster titles, esports graphics, gaming vlogs, techno music album covers, streetwear apparel prints, sticker designs, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!",
